      "estimatedOutput": 678,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/guwen-348--81fb3ad42fbce2ec0d23766520d78df3482d85ffdd7d3e05ac31d51b9ececc3e.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "guwen-349",
      "category": "古文",
      "title": "围炉夜话·第一二五则",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "王永彬",
      "dynasty": "清",
      "content": "甘受人欺，定非懦弱；自谓予智，终是糊涂。",
      "excerptOf": "围炉夜话",
      "excerptNote": "完整选录《围炉夜话》中“第一二五则”一则或一章；非全书。",
