      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/guwen-351--af0ce5eda743f13a0c6167755c3db441a7b79aa8c2fa5f7dc6f33bd38dcfccb0.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "guwen-352",
      "category": "古文",
      "title": "围炉夜话·第一二八则",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "王永彬",
      "dynasty": "清",
      "content": "富家惯习骄奢，最难教子；寒士欲谋生活，还是读书。",
      "excerptOf": "围炉夜话",
      "excerptNote": "完整选录《围炉夜话》中“第一二八则”一则或一章；非全书。",
      "inputHash": "7eb15fcd87ad98d647f79c984430ba5dbe7960dc3e144a4410d8e34512285d9d",
